{"id":"A1-L036","title":"There is / There are: introduction","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U03","focus":"There is / There are — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"There is / There are — introdução","pron":"sílaba tônica em palavras comuns","verbs":["wake"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["oven","dishwasher","fridge","stove","middle","tap","cupboard","drawer","microwave","counter","blender","lid","rack","mixer"],"field":"Alimentação","genre":"E-mail, carta, mensagem","skill":"Escrita","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 36 · There is / There are: introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** There is / There are — introdução.","**Verbos:** wake.","**Pronúncia:** sílaba tônica em palavras comuns.","**14 palavras novas** (alimentação).","**Texto do dia:** e-mail, carta, mensagem."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo dizer o que existe em um lugar e ler um e-mail."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["oven","forno"],["dishwasher","lava-louças"],["fridge","geladeira"],["stove","fogão"],["middle","meio"],["tap","torneira"],["cupboard","armário"],["drawer","gaveta"],["microwave","micro-ondas"],["counter","bancada"],["blender","liquidificador"],["lid","tampa"],["rack","suporte"],["mixer","batedeira"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An e-mail","blocks":[{"type":"mail","from":"ana@mail.com","to":"leo@mail.com","subject":"Our new kitchen","paras":["Hi Leo!","Come and see our new kitchen! **There is** a big table in the middle and **there are** four chairs.","**There is** an oven, and **there are** two windows. **There isn’t** a dishwasher yet.","I wake up early, so I make breakfast at six. Ana"],"gloss":[["oven","forno"],["dishwasher","lava-louças"],["chair","cadeira"],["middle","meio"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"There is a big table.","ans":"T","why":"“There is a big table.”"},{"q":"There are six chairs.","ans":"F","why":"Quatro."},{"q":"There is a dishwasher.","ans":"F","why":"“There isn’t.”"},{"q":"The kitchen is old.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“oven” means…","opts":["forno","geladeira","fogão"],"ans":0,"why":"oven = forno."},{"q":"“middle” means…","opts":["meio","canto","topo"],"ans":0,"why":"middle = meio."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"There is / There are","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Singular","Plural"],"rows":[["**There is** a table.","**There are** four chairs."],["**There isn’t** a dishwasher.","**There aren’t** any windows."],["**Is there** an oven?","**Are there** any chairs?"]],"cap":"There is / are"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"some / any","body":"**some** em afirmativa, **any** em negativa e pergunta: *There are some chairs. There aren’t any windows.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"___ a table in the kitchen.","a":"There is","why":"singular.","say":"There is a table"},{"s":"___ four chairs.","a":"There are","why":"plural."},{"s":"___ a dishwasher? — No, there isn’t.","a":"Is there","why":"pergunta singular."},{"s":"There aren’t ___ windows. (any/some)","a":"any","why":"negativa → any."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["oven","forno"],["dishwasher","lava-louças"],["chair","cadeira"],["table","mesa"],["fridge","geladeira"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["is","Yes","there"],"ans":"Yes there is","pt":"Tem."},{"words":["there","an","oven","Is"],"ans":"Is there an oven","pt":"Tem forno?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"oven","pos":"noun","pt":"forno","ex":"A hot oven.","expt":"Um forno quente."},{"w":"dishwasher","pos":"noun","pt":"lava-louças","ex":"A new dishwasher.","expt":"Um lava-louças novo."},{"w":"fridge","pos":"noun","pt":"geladeira","ex":"The fridge is full.","expt":"A geladeira está cheia."},{"w":"stove","pos":"noun","pt":"fogão","ex":"A gas stove.","expt":"Um fogão a gás."},{"w":"middle","pos":"noun","pt":"meio","ex":"In the middle.","expt":"No meio."},{"w":"tap","pos":"word","pt":"torneira","ex":"Turn off the tap.","expt":"Feche a torneira."},{"w":"cupboard","pos":"word","pt":"armário","ex":"Plates in the cupboard.","expt":"Pratos no armário."},{"w":"drawer","pos":"word","pt":"gaveta","ex":"Forks in the drawer.","expt":"Garfos na gaveta."},{"w":"microwave","pos":"word","pt":"micro-ondas","ex":"Use the microwave.","expt":"Use o micro-ondas."},{"w":"counter","pos":"word","pt":"bancada","ex":"On the counter.","expt":"Na bancada."},{"w":"blender","pos":"word","pt":"liquidificador","ex":"A noisy blender.","expt":"Um liquidificador barulhento."},{"w":"lid","pos":"word","pt":"tampa","ex":"Put on the lid.","expt":"Ponha a tampa."},{"w":"rack","pos":"word","pt":"suporte","ex":"A dish rack.","expt":"Um escorredor."},{"w":"mixer","pos":"word","pt":"batedeira","ex":"A kitchen mixer.","expt":"Uma batedeira."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**What is in your kitchen?** — O que tem na sua cozinha?","**There is a table and four chairs.** — Tem uma mesa e quatro cadeiras.","**Is there an oven?** — Tem forno?","**There’s a lot of space.** — Tem muito espaço.","**It’s well equipped.** — É bem equipado.","**Make yourself at home.** — Fique à vontade."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"wake","pt":"acordar","forms":[["I wake","I wake early."],["you wake","You wake the dog."],["he / she / it wakes","She wakes at six."],["we / they wake","We wake together."]],"note":"**wake up** e **wake** têm quase o mesmo sentido."}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Our kitchen","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Our kitchen","lines":[["Leo","What is in your kitchen?","O que tem na sua cozinha?"],["Ana","There is a table and four chairs.","Tem uma mesa e quatro cadeiras."],["Leo","Is there an oven?","Tem forno?"],["Ana","Yes, there is.","Tem."],["Leo","Are there any windows?","Tem janelas?"],["Ana","Yes, there are two.","Sim, duas."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: sílaba tônica em palavras comuns","items":[{"label":"sílaba tônica em palavras comuns","note":"Sílaba tônica: KITchen, WINdow, TAble, CHAIR. Treine.","words":["kitchen","window","table","chair"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Describe your kitchen with there is / are.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"There is a table. There are three chairs."},{"q":"Ask: Is there an oven?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"Is there an oven?"},{"q":"Say what there isn’t.","pt":"Diga.","model":"There isn’t a dishwasher."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences about your room with there is / are.","model":"There is a bed. There are two windows. There isn’t a TV. There is a desk. Is there a chair? Yes, there is.","checklist":["Usei **there is**","Usei **there are**","Usei **uma negativa**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “oven” mean?","opts":["lava-louças","mesa","forno"],"ans":2,"why":"**oven** = forno."},{"q":"What does “dishwasher” mean?","opts":["lava-louças","cadeira","geladeira"],"ans":0,"why":"**dishwasher** = lava-louças."},{"q":"What does “chair” mean?","opts":["mesa","cadeira","fogão"],"ans":1,"why":"**chair** = cadeira."},{"q":"What does “table” mean?","opts":["geladeira","meio","mesa"],"ans":2,"why":"**table** = mesa."},{"q":"Which is correct?","opts":["There are two chairs.","There is two chairs.","There be two chairs."],"ans":0,"why":"plural → are."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["No **Listening**, “there’s” é contração de “there is”.","No **Reading**, descrições de lugar usam *there is/are*."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Faça um **desenho da cozinha** e descreva.","Compare **there is × it is**.","Erro típico: *“Have a table.”* → *There is a table.*"]}]}]}